  "duration_s": 434.399002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了第十到第六，虎丘塔斜了一千年不倒，小雁塔裂了三次，自己合上松。岳寺塔是全国唯一的十二边形大理三塔堆土，修了千年不塌。六合塔送走了鲁智深，留住了武松。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说应县木塔呢？大雁塔呢？雷峰塔呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个悬。最后那个一根木头没烂，一块砖没碎，一千年了还占着老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，陕西西安大雁塔建于唐永辉三年，建元六百五十二年，玄奘法是为了存放从印度带回来的经卷和佛像亲自主持。修的这塔最绝的地方不是他有多高，是他底下有什么法门寺宝塔底下发现了地宫，出土了半个盛唐大雁塔底下呢专家说了，肯定也有地宫，到现在没发掘，也没被盗。为什么？因为大雁塔的地宫里极有可能藏着玄奘从印度带回来的贝叶经背叶经鼻纸结实，如果保存完好，那些一千三百多年前的经卷可能还在里面躺着。玄奘走了五万里路带回六百五十七部经书，翻译了一辈子。最后那些原版经卷就埋在塔底下，没人敢动。您说这是给后人留的悬念，还是给玄奘留的清净？第四名，山西朔州应县木塔建于辽，清明二年，公元一千零五十六年，全名佛宫寺释迦塔高六十七点三一米，相当于二十二层楼。全木头搭的没用一根铁钉，全靠榫卯和斗拱，一根扣一根一层压一层光斗骨，就有五十四种样式，人称斗拱博物馆近一千年里，经历了四十多次地震。民国军阀混战的时候，两百多发炮弹打在他身上，但恐现在还能看见他照样站着。一九二六年，军阀打仗，炮弹把塔身打的千疮百孔，木塔没倒，一九七六年唐山大地震应线震感强烈，木塔没倒。您说一堆木头搭的塔，扛过地震，扛过炮弹扛了一千年。这是什么手艺？这是什么样的智慧？第三名，浙江杭州雷峰塔建于北宋，公元九百七十七年，吴越王钱弘修的这塔最有名的不是他是传说。白蛇传里，法海把白娘子压在雷峰塔底下，鲁迅先生还写过一篇文章，叫论雷峰塔的倒调。一九二四年雷峰塔真的倒了，倒了以后，大家以为故事就这么完了。没想到两千年考古队清理废墟在地宫里挖出来一件东西。纯银的阿育王塔里面有一个金盒子盒子里装着佛罗纪发舍利佛罗纪发是什么？就是佛祖释迦牟尼的头发，全世界就这一份，白娘子没找着找着了佛祖的头发，一座塔压着一段爱情传说，也压着一件佛教至宝。您说这是巧合还是天意？第二名，河南开封开宝寺塔，也叫开封铁塔。建于北宋，皇佑元年，公元一千零四十九年，这不是铁塔，是琉璃铁塔，因为砖的颜色像铁锈，所以叫铁塔。高五十五点二八八米十三层。这塔最绝的地方是，他扛得住。建成以来，经历了三十八次六级以上地震九次，黄河水患。抗日战争时期，日军用炮弹轰塔身上，现在还留着弹孔，它就是不倒，怎么做到的？塔里面有一根塔心柱，从底一直通到顶螺旋式的台阶，把塔心柱和外墙死死连在一起。外面怎么画？里面是抱团的一座塔，扛了地震，扛了洪水，扛了炮弹。九百多年了，连块砖都没掉，您说这琉璃砖是不是比铁还硬？第一名，陕西西安建福寺、小雁塔等等。小雁塔不是第九名吗？对，第九名是小雁塔的塔。我说的第一名是小雁塔底下的那套地基，您知道小雁塔为什么裂了三次都能合上吗？不是神，是地基。考古队勘探以后发现，小雁塔底下是一整套夯土和卵石交替的地基，一层土一层石头，一层土，一层石头就像一个弹簧。地震来了，地基先把力卸掉，大半传到塔身上的力已经没那么大了，所以塔裂了，能合合了，能再裂。这套地基从唐朝一直管到今天，一一千三百多年别的古塔靠的是塔身结石。小雁塔靠的是地底下有弹性，这才是真正坐头把交椅的东西。不是他有多高，是地基有多软软的，比硬的更扛得住。您听出来了没有？这十座古塔没有一座是光靠高出名的虎丘塔，靠的是邪而不倒。小雁塔靠的是裂而复合。松岳寺塔靠的是全国孤立大理三塔，靠的是堆土建塔，六和塔靠的是水浒英雄，大雁塔靠的是地宫悬念。应县木塔靠的是无丁无卯，雷峰塔靠的是白蛇传说，开封铁塔靠的是炮弹轰不倒。小雁塔靠的是地基有弹性，您发现没有？这些塔厉害的地方，不在于砖有多硬，木头有多好，在于每一座都把古人的智慧刻在了骨子里。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 670,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00002",
      "start_ms": 670,
      "end_ms": 2550,
      "text": "咱们盘了第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2990,
      "end_ms": 5130,
      "text": "虎丘塔斜了一千年不倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5770,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "小雁塔裂了三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7490,
      "end_ms": 9370,
      "text": "自己合上松。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9370,
      "end_ms": 15010,
      "text": "岳寺塔是全国唯一的十二边形大理三塔堆土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15050,
      "end_ms": 16370,
      "text": "修了千年不塌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16870,
      "end_ms": 18890,
      "text": "六合塔送走了鲁智深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19190,
      "end_ms": 20090,
      "text": "留住了武松。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20930,
      "end_ms": 23370,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24150,
      "end_ms": 26790,
      "text": "有人说应县木塔呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26910,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "大雁塔呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28010,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "雷峰塔呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28990,
      "end_ms": 29635,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31040,
      "end_ms": 33760,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34240,
      "end_ms": 35440,
      "text": "一个比一个悬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35900,
      "end_ms": 38420,
      "text": "最后那个一根木头没烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00018",
      "start_ms": 38640,
      "end_ms": 39860,
      "text": "一块砖没碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40040,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "一千年了还占着老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47400,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00021",
      "start_ms": 51300,
      "end_ms": 51960,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52840,
      "end_ms": 57760,
      "text": "陕西西安大雁塔建于唐永辉三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58260,
      "end_ms": 59795,
      "text": "建元六百五十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60160,
      "end_ms": 66090,
      "text": "玄奘法是为了存放从印度带回来的经卷和佛像亲自主持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66090,
      "end_ms": 69795,
      "text": "修的这塔最绝的地方不是他有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00026",
      "start_ms": 70180,
      "end_ms": 74165,
      "text": "是他底下有什么法门寺宝塔底下发现了地宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00027",
      "start_ms": 74620,
      "end_ms": 78980,
      "text": "出土了半个盛唐大雁塔底下呢专家说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79100,
      "end_ms": 80515,
      "text": "肯定也有地宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00029",
      "start_ms": 81000,
      "end_ms": 82540,
      "text": "到现在没发掘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82720,
      "end_ms": 83565,
      "text": "也没被盗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00031",
      "start_ms": 84310,
      "end_ms": 84975,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00032",
      "start_ms": 85280,
      "end_ms": 93705,
      "text": "因为大雁塔的地宫里极有可能藏着玄奘从印度带回来的贝叶经背叶经鼻纸结实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94030,
      "end_ms": 95265,
      "text": "如果保存完好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00034",
      "start_ms": 95530,
      "end_ms": 99445,
      "text": "那些一千三百多年前的经卷可能还在里面躺着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00035",
      "start_ms": 99850,
      "end_ms": 103685,
      "text": "玄奘走了五万里路带回六百五十七部经书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00036",
      "start_ms": 104300,
      "end_ms": 105465,
      "text": "翻译了一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00037",
      "start_ms": 105760,
      "end_ms": 109045,
      "text": "最后那些原版经卷就埋在塔底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109400,
      "end_ms": 110155,
      "text": "没人敢动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110750,
      "end_ms": 113270,
      "text": "您说这是给后人留的悬念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00040",
      "start_ms": 113470,
      "end_ms": 115435,
      "text": "还是给玄奘留的清净？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00041",
      "start_ms": 116540,
      "end_ms": 117285,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00042",
      "start_ms": 118260,
      "end_ms": 122150,
      "text": "山西朔州应县木塔建于辽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122210,
      "end_ms": 123195,
      "text": "清明二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 126225,
      "text": "公元一千零五十六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127180,
      "end_ms": 133045,
      "text": "全名佛宫寺释迦塔高六十七点三一米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00046",
      "start_ms": 133610,
      "end_ms": 135265,
      "text": "相当于二十二层楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00047",
      "start_ms": 136130,
      "end_ms": 138480,
      "text": "全木头搭的没用一根铁钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00048",
      "start_ms": 138840,
      "end_ms": 140535,
      "text": "全靠榫卯和斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00049",
      "start_ms": 140890,
      "end_ms": 144445,
      "text": "一根扣一根一层压一层光斗骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00050",
      "start_ms": 144740,
      "end_ms": 146585,
      "text": "就有五十四种样式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00051",
      "start_ms": 147240,
      "end_ms": 151375,
      "text": "人称斗拱博物馆近一千年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00052",
      "start_ms": 151630,
      "end_ms": 153465,
      "text": "经历了四十多次地震。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00053",
      "start_ms": 154330,
      "end_ms": 156150,
      "text": "民国军阀混战的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00054",
      "start_ms": 156310,
      "end_ms": 158990,
      "text": "两百多发炮弹打在他身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00055",
      "start_ms": 159110,
      "end_ms": 161845,
      "text": "但恐现在还能看见他照样站着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00056",
      "start_ms": 162410,
      "end_ms": 163365,
      "text": "一九二六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163680,
      "end_ms": 164415,
      "text": "军阀打仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00058",
      "start_ms": 164820,
      "end_ms": 167255,
      "text": "炮弹把塔身打的千疮百孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00059",
      "start_ms": 167710,
      "end_ms": 168555,
      "text": "木塔没倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00060",
      "start_ms": 168990,
      "end_ms": 173565,
      "text": "一九七六年唐山大地震应线震感强烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173920,
      "end_ms": 174785,
      "text": "木塔没倒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175240,
      "end_ms": 177360,
      "text": "您说一堆木头搭的塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00063",
      "start_ms": 177620,
      "end_ms": 178600,
      "text": "扛过地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00064",
      "start_ms": 178780,
      "end_ms": 180915,
      "text": "扛过炮弹扛了一千年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00065",
      "start_ms": 181690,
      "end_ms": 182710,
      "text": "这是什么手艺？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00066",
      "start_ms": 182870,
      "end_ms": 184135,
      "text": "这是什么样的智慧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184600,
      "end_ms": 185220,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00068",
      "start_ms": 185540,
      "end_ms": 188275,
      "text": "浙江杭州雷峰塔建于北宋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00069",
      "start_ms": 188710,
      "end_ms": 190335,
      "text": "公元九百七十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00070",
      "start_ms": 190750,
      "end_ms": 197045,
      "text": "吴越王钱弘修的这塔最有名的不是他是传说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00071",
      "start_ms": 197450,
      "end_ms": 198345,
      "text": "白蛇传里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00072",
      "start_ms": 198840,
      "end_ms": 202035,
      "text": "法海把白娘子压在雷峰塔底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00073",
      "start_ms": 202580,
      "end_ms": 204565,
      "text": "鲁迅先生还写过一篇文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00074",
      "start_ms": 204910,
      "end_ms": 206990,
      "text": "叫论雷峰塔的倒调。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00075",
      "start_ms": 207390,
      "end_ms": 210295,
      "text": "一九二四年雷峰塔真的倒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00076",
      "start_ms": 210570,
      "end_ms": 211250,
      "text": "倒了以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00077",
      "start_ms": 211450,
      "end_ms": 213465,
      "text": "大家以为故事就这么完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00078",
      "start_ms": 213900,
      "end_ms": 221265,
      "text": "没想到两千年考古队清理废墟在地宫里挖出来一件东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221580,
      "end_ms": 231190,
      "text": "纯银的阿育王塔里面有一个金盒子盒子里装着佛罗纪发舍利佛罗纪发是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00080",
      "start_ms": 231330,
      "end_ms": 233550,
      "text": "就是佛祖释迦牟尼的头发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00081",
      "start_ms": 233730,
      "end_ms": 235085,
      "text": "全世界就这一份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00082",
      "start_ms": 235420,
      "end_ms": 238565,
      "text": "白娘子没找着找着了佛祖的头发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00083",
      "start_ms": 238840,
      "end_ms": 241750,
      "text": "一座塔压着一段爱情传说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00084",
      "start_ms": 242190,
      "end_ms": 244090,
      "text": "也压着一件佛教至宝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00085",
      "start_ms": 244830,
      "end_ms": 248090,
      "text": "您说这是巧合还是天意？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00086",
      "start_ms": 249010,
      "end_ms": 249650,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00087",
      "start_ms": 250550,
      "end_ms": 252650,
      "text": "河南开封开宝寺塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00088",
      "start_ms": 253330,
      "end_ms": 254910,
      "text": "也叫开封铁塔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00089",
      "start_ms": 255230,
      "end_ms": 256290,
      "text": "建于北宋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00090",
      "start_ms": 256330,
      "end_ms": 257250,
      "text": "皇佑元年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00091",
      "start_ms": 258150,
      "end_ms": 260190,
      "text": "公元一千零四十九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00092",
      "start_ms": 260930,
      "end_ms": 262030,
      "text": "这不是铁塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00093",
      "start_ms": 262390,
      "end_ms": 263650,
      "text": "是琉璃铁塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00094",
      "start_ms": 264130,
      "end_ms": 266290,
      "text": "因为砖的颜色像铁锈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00095",
      "start_ms": 266590,
      "end_ms": 267450,
      "text": "所以叫铁塔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00096",
      "start_ms": 267450,
      "end_ms": 271580,
      "text": "高五十五点二八八米十三层。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00097",
      "start_ms": 272060,
      "end_ms": 273980,
      "text": "这塔最绝的地方是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00098",
      "start_ms": 273980,
      "end_ms": 274700,
      "text": "他扛得住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00099",
      "start_ms": 274800,
      "end_ms": 275600,
      "text": "建成以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00100",
      "start_ms": 275840,
      "end_ms": 280260,
      "text": "经历了三十八次六级以上地震九次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00101",
      "start_ms": 280420,
      "end_ms": 281460,
      "text": "黄河水患。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281860,
      "end_ms": 283020,
      "text": "抗日战争时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00103",
      "start_ms": 283380,
      "end_ms": 286500,
      "text": "日军用炮弹轰塔身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00104",
      "start_ms": 286540,
      "end_ms": 287740,
      "text": "现在还留着弹孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00105",
      "start_ms": 287920,
      "end_ms": 288760,
      "text": "它就是不倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00106",
      "start_ms": 289200,
      "end_ms": 290200,
      "text": "怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00107",
      "start_ms": 290320,
      "end_ms": 292180,
      "text": "塔里面有一根塔心柱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00108",
      "start_ms": 292580,
      "end_ms": 296060,
      "text": "从底一直通到顶螺旋式的台阶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00109",
      "start_ms": 296520,
      "end_ms": 299060,
      "text": "把塔心柱和外墙死死连在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00110",
      "start_ms": 299380,
      "end_ms": 300270,
      "text": "外面怎么画？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00111",
      "start_ms": 300450,
      "end_ms": 302710,
      "text": "里面是抱团的一座塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00112",
      "start_ms": 303630,
      "end_ms": 304530,
      "text": "扛了地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00113",
      "start_ms": 304530,
      "end_ms": 305310,
      "text": "扛了洪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00114",
      "start_ms": 305410,
      "end_ms": 306265,
      "text": "扛了炮弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00115",
      "start_ms": 307100,
      "end_ms": 308220,
      "text": "九百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00116",
      "start_ms": 308600,
      "end_ms": 310380,
      "text": "连块砖都没掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00117",
      "start_ms": 310640,
      "end_ms": 313320,
      "text": "您说这琉璃砖是不是比铁还硬？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00118",
      "start_ms": 314400,
      "end_ms": 314999,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00119",
      "start_ms": 315220,
      "end_ms": 318700,
      "text": "陕西西安建福寺、小雁塔等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00120",
      "start_ms": 319360,
      "end_ms": 321100,
      "text": "小雁塔不是第九名吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00121",
      "start_ms": 321940,
      "end_ms": 322180,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00122",
      "start_ms": 323160,
      "end_ms": 325520,
      "text": "第九名是小雁塔的塔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00123",
      "start_ms": 325680,
      "end_ms": 329900,
      "text": "我说的第一名是小雁塔底下的那套地基，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00124",
      "start_ms": 330860,
      "end_ms": 334980,
      "text": "您知道小雁塔为什么裂了三次都能合上吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00125",
      "start_ms": 335700,
      "end_ms": 336360,
      "text": "不是神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00126",
      "start_ms": 336870,
      "end_ms": 337530,
      "text": "是地基。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00127",
      "start_ms": 338430,
      "end_ms": 340210,
      "text": "考古队勘探以后发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00128",
      "start_ms": 340230,
      "end_ms": 345770,
      "text": "小雁塔底下是一整套夯土和卵石交替的地基，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00129",
      "start_ms": 346350,
      "end_ms": 348470,
      "text": "一层土一层石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00130",
      "start_ms": 348750,
      "end_ms": 349490,
      "text": "一层土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00131",
      "start_ms": 349910,
      "end_ms": 352430,
      "text": "一层石头就像一个弹簧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00132",
      "start_ms": 352630,
      "end_ms": 353490,
      "text": "地震来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00133",
      "start_ms": 353670,
      "end_ms": 355010,
      "text": "地基先把力卸掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00134",
      "start_ms": 355010,
      "end_ms": 358950,
      "text": "大半传到塔身上的力已经没那么大了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00135",
      "start_ms": 359270,
      "end_ms": 360370,
      "text": "所以塔裂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00136",
      "start_ms": 360370,
      "end_ms": 361390,
      "text": "能合合了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00137",
      "start_ms": 361390,
      "end_ms": 361990,
      "text": "能再裂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00138",
      "start_ms": 362510,
      "end_ms": 365610,
      "text": "这套地基从唐朝一直管到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00139",
      "start_ms": 365610,
      "end_ms": 370815,
      "text": "一一千三百多年别的古塔靠的是塔身结石。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00140",
      "start_ms": 371610,
      "end_ms": 373995,
      "text": "小雁塔靠的是地底下有弹性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00141",
      "start_ms": 374770,
      "end_ms": 378165,
      "text": "这才是真正坐头把交椅的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00142",
      "start_ms": 379230,
      "end_ms": 380435,
      "text": "不是他有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00143",
      "start_ms": 380740,
      "end_ms": 382805,
      "text": "是地基有多软软的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00144",
      "start_ms": 383100,
      "end_ms": 384635,
      "text": "比硬的更扛得住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00145",
      "start_ms": 385060,
      "end_ms": 386275,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00146",
      "start_ms": 386600,
      "end_ms": 392230,
      "text": "这十座古塔没有一座是光靠高出名的虎丘塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00147",
      "start_ms": 392250,
      "end_ms": 393575,
      "text": "靠的是邪而不倒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00148",
      "start_ms": 394210,
      "end_ms": 396570,
      "text": "小雁塔靠的是裂而复合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00149",
      "start_ms": 397150,
      "end_ms": 401430,
      "text": "松岳寺塔靠的是全国孤立大理三塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00150",
      "start_ms": 401670,
      "end_ms": 403575,
      "text": "靠的是堆土建塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00151",
      "start_ms": 403980,
      "end_ms": 405925,
      "text": "六和塔靠的是水浒英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00152",
      "start_ms": 406580,
      "end_ms": 408825,
      "text": "大雁塔靠的是地宫悬念。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00153",
      "start_ms": 409520,
      "end_ms": 412035,
      "text": "应县木塔靠的是无丁无卯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00154",
      "start_ms": 412550,
      "end_ms": 414790,
      "text": "雷峰塔靠的是白蛇传说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00155",
      "start_ms": 415370,
      "end_ms": 418225,
      "text": "开封铁塔靠的是炮弹轰不倒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00156",
      "start_ms": 418760,
      "end_ms": 421095,
      "text": "小雁塔靠的是地基有弹性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00157",
      "start_ms": 421440,
      "end_ms": 422245,
      "text": "您发现没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00158",
      "start_ms": 422550,
      "end_ms": 424175,
      "text": "这些塔厉害的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00159",
      "start_ms": 424490,
      "end_ms": 426135,
      "text": "不在于砖有多硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00160",
      "start_ms": 426520,
      "end_ms": 427600,
      "text": "木头有多好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00161",
      "start_ms": 427760,
      "end_ms": 431700,
      "text": "在于每一座都把古人的智慧刻在了骨子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00162",
      "start_ms": 431780,
      "end_ms": 432580,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_01240cafd3ecb0d6_s00163",
      "start_ms": 432780,
      "end_ms": 434285,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
